<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria stock hit by share issue, politics.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria stock hit by share issue, politics.</headline>
<byline>Janet McBride</byline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria shares took a knock in Vienna on Friday as the nation's top bank sought to raise three billion schillings in equity while a government row over its planned privatisation rumbled on.</p>
<p>Bank Austria said it would issue almost eight million preference shares at 376 schillings each in a public tender from June 9-23. The issue carried a 10 percent discount to Thursday's close and was priced below market expectations.</p>
